<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Angular Concepts Guide</title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link
      href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=IBM+Plex+Mono:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;1,400&family=Syne:wght@400;500;600;700&family=DM+Sans:ital,opsz,wght@0,9..40,300;0,9..40,400;0,9..40,500;1,9..40,300&display=swap"
      rel="stylesheet"
    />
    <style>
      :root {
        --bg: #0d0f14;
        --bg-2: #13161e;
        --bg-3: #1a1e28;
        --bg-4: #222736;
        --border: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.07);
        --border-2: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.13);
        --text: #e8eaf0;
        --text-2: #8b90a0;
        --text-3: #555b6e;
        --accent: #e8564a;
        --blue: #4a9eff;
        --teal: #2dcba0;
        --amber: #f0a832;
        --purple: #a78bfa;
        --green: #4ade80;
        --coral: #fb7185;
        --kw: #a78bfa;
        --str: #2dcba0;
        --dec: #f07c72;
        --num: #f0a832;
        --cm: #555b6e;
        --radius: 10px;
        --radius-lg: 14px;
      }

      * {
        box-sizing: border-box;
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
      }

      body {
        background: var(--bg);
        color: var(--text);
        font-family: "DM Sans", sans-serif;
        font-size: 15px;
        line-height: 1.7;
        min-height: 100vh;
      }

      .layout {
        display: flex;
        min-height: 100vh;
      }

      /* ── SIDEBAR ── */
      .sidebar {
        width: 260px;
        min-width: 260px;
        background: var(--bg-2);
        border-right: 1px solid var(--border);
        padding: 0;
        position: sticky;
        top: 0;
        height: 100vh;
        overflow-y: auto;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
      }

      .sidebar-logo {
        padding: 1.5rem 1.5rem 1.25rem;
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
      }

      .sidebar-logo .logo-tag {
        font-family: "IBM Plex Mono", monospace;
        font-size: 9px;
        color: var(--accent);
        letter-spacing: 0.14em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        margin-bottom: 5px;
      }

      .sidebar-logo h1 {
        font-family: "Syne", sans-serif;
        font-size: 19px;
        font-weight: 700;
        color: var(--text);
        line-height: 1.2;
      }

      .sidebar-logo .version {
        font-size: 11px;
        color: var(--text-3);
        margin-top: 5px;
        font-family: "IBM Plex Mono", monospace;
      }

      .nav-group-label {
        font-size: 9.5px;
        font-weight: 600;
        letter-spacing: 0.12em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        color: var(--text-3);
        padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem 0.4rem;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 8px;
      }

      .nav-group-label::after {
        content: "";
        flex: 1;
        height: 1px;
        background: var(--border);
      }

      .nav-btn {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 10px;
        width: 100%;
        padding: 0.5rem 1.5rem;
        background: none;
        border: none;
        color: var(--text-2);
        font-family: "DM Sans", sans-serif;
        font-size: 13.5px;
        cursor: pointer;
        text-align: left;
        transition: all 0.15s;
        border-left: 2px solid transparent;
        line-height: 1.3;
      }

      .nav-btn:hover {
        color: var(--text);
        background: var(--bg-3);
      }
      .nav-btn.active {
        color: var(--text);
        background: var(--bg-3);
        border-left-color: var(--accent);
      }

      .nav-dot {
        width: 5px;
        height: 5px;
        border-radius: 50%;
        background: var(--border-2);
        flex-shrink: 0;
      }
      .nav-btn.active .nav-dot {
        background: var(--accent);
      }

      /* ── MAIN ── */
      .main {
        flex: 1;
        padding: 3rem 3.5rem;
        max-width: 900px;
        overflow-x: hidden;
      }

      .section {
        display: none;
        animation: fadeIn 0.2s ease;
      }
      .section.visible {
        display: block;
      }
      @keyframes fadeIn {
        from {
          opacity: 0;
          transform: translateY(5px);
        }
        to {
          opacity: 1;
          transform: translateY(0);
        }
      }

      .section-header {
        margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
      }

      .section-tag {
        font-family: "IBM Plex Mono", monospace;
        font-size: 9px;
        letter-spacing: 0.14em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        color: var(--accent);
        margin-bottom: 8px;
      }

      .section-header h2 {
        font-family: "Syne", sans-serif;
        font-size: 28px;
        font-weight: 700;
        color: var(--text);
        margin-bottom: 8px;
        line-height: 1.2;
      }

      .section-header .subtitle {
        font-size: 15px;
        color: var(--text-2);
        line-height: 1.65;
        padding-bottom: 1.5rem;
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
      }

      /* ── CONTENT BLOCKS ── */
      .block {
        margin-bottom: 2.25rem;
      }

      .block h3 {
        font-family: "Syne", sans-serif;
        font-size: 16px;
        font-weight: 600;
        color: var(--text);
        margin-bottom: 0.65rem;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 8px;
      }

      .block h3::before {
        content: "";
        display: inline-block;
        width: 3px;
        height: 14px;
        background: var(--accent);
        border-radius: 2px;
        flex-shrink: 0;
      }

      .block p {
        font-size: 14.5px;
        color: var(--text-2);
        line-height: 1.8;
        margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
      }

      .block p:last-child {
        margin-bottom: 0;
      }

      /* ── CODE ── */
      code {
        font-family: "IBM Plex Mono", monospace;
        font-size: 12.5px;
        background: var(--bg-3);
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        padding: 2px 7px;
        border-radius: 5px;
        color: var(--teal);
      }

      pre {
        font-family: "IBM Plex Mono", monospace;
        font-size: 12.5px;
        line-height: 1.7;
        background: var(--bg-2);
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
        padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
        margin: 1rem 0;
        overflow-x: auto;
        color: var(--text);
        position: relative;
      }

      pre::before {
        content: attr(data-lang);
        position: absolute;
        top: 10px;
        right: 14px;
        font-size: 9px;
        letter-spacing: 0.1em;
        color: var(--text-3);
        text-transform: uppercase;
      }

      .kw {
        color: var(--kw);
      }
      .str {
        color: var(--str);
      }
      .dec {
        color: var(--dec);
      }
      .num {
        color: var(--num);
      }
      .cm {
        color: var(--cm);
        font-style: italic;
      }
      .tp {
        color: var(--amber);
      }

      /* ── CARDS ── */
      .card-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(185px, 1fr));
        gap: 12px;
        margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
      }

      .card {
        background: var(--bg-2);
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
        padding: 1.1rem 1.25rem;
        transition:
          border-color 0.2s,
          transform 0.15s;
      }

      .card:hover {
        border-color: var(--border-2);
        transform: translateY(-1px);
      }
      .card-eyebrow {
        font-size: 10px;
        font-weight: 600;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 0.1em;
        margin-bottom: 6px;
      }
      .card-name {
        font-family: "Syne", sans-serif;
        font-size: 15px;
        font-weight: 600;
        color: var(--text);
        margin-bottom: 5px;
      }
      .card-desc {
        font-size: 12.5px;
        color: var(--text-2);
        line-height: 1.5;
      }

      .col-blue .card-eyebrow {
        color: var(--blue);
      }
      .col-teal .card-eyebrow {
        color: var(--teal);
      }
      .col-amber .card-eyebrow {
        color: var(--amber);
      }
      .col-coral .card-eyebrow {
        color: var(--coral);
      }
      .col-purple .card-eyebrow {
        color: var(--purple);
      }
      .col-green .card-eyebrow {
        color: var(--green);
      }

      /* ── NOTES ── */
      .note {
        border-left: 3px solid var(--purple);
        background: rgba(167, 139, 250, 0.06);
        border-radius: 0 var(--radius) var(--radius) 0;
        padding: 0.9rem 1.1rem;
        margin: 1rem 0;
      }
      .note.teal {
        border-color: var(--teal);
        background: rgba(45, 203, 160, 0.06);
      }
      .note.amber {
        border-color: var(--amber);
        background: rgba(240, 168, 50, 0.06);
      }
      .note.coral {
        border-color: var(--coral);
        background: rgba(251, 113, 133, 0.06);
      }
      .note.blue {
        border-color: var(--blue);
        background: rgba(74, 158, 255, 0.06);
      }
      .note.green {
        border-color: var(--green);
        background: rgba(74, 222, 128, 0.06);
      }

      .note p {
        font-size: 13.5px;
        color: var(--text-2);
        line-height: 1.65;
        margin: 0;
      }
      .note strong {
        color: var(--text);
        font-weight: 500;
      }

      .note-label {
        font-size: 9.5px;
        font-weight: 600;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 0.1em;
        margin-bottom: 5px;
      }
      .note .note-label {
        color: var(--purple);
      }
      .note.teal .note-label {
        color: var(--teal);
      }
      .note.amber .note-label {
        color: var(--amber);
      }
      .note.coral .note-label {
        color: var(--coral);
      }
      .note.blue .note-label {
        color: var(--blue);
      }
      .note.green .note-label {
        color: var(--green);
      }

      /* ── COMPARE ── */
      .compare {
        /* display: grid;*/
        grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
        gap: 12px;
        margin: 1rem 0;
      }

      .compare-cell {
        background: var(--bg-2);
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        border-radius: var(--radius);
        padding: 0.9rem 1.1rem;
      }

      .compare-cell .label {
        font-size: 9.5px;
        font-weight: 600;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 0.1em;
        color: var(--accent);
        margin-bottom: 7px;
      }

      .compare-cell p {
        font-size: 13px;
        color: var(--text-2);
        line-height: 1.6;
        margin: 0;
      }

      /* ── STEPS ── */
      .steps {
        margin: 1rem 0;
      }
      .step {
        display: flex;
        gap: 14px;
        margin-bottom: 12px;
        align-items: flex-start;
      }
      .step-num {
        min-width: 28px;
        height: 28px;
        border-radius: 50%;
        background: var(--bg-3);
        border: 1px solid var(--border-2);
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        font-family: "IBM Plex Mono", monospace;
        font-size: 11px;
        font-weight: 500;
        color: var(--accent);
        flex-shrink: 0;
      }
      .step-body {
        flex: 1;
        font-size: 14px;
        color: var(--text-2);
        line-height: 1.65;
        padding-top: 3px;
      }

      /* ── RULE LIST ── */
      .rule-list {
        list-style: none;
        padding: 0;
        margin: 0.5rem 0;
      }
      .rule-list li {
        font-size: 14px;
        color: var(--text-2);
        padding: 7px 0 7px 20px;
        position: relative;
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
        line-height: 1.55;
      }
      .rule-list li:last-child {
        border: none;
      }
      .rule-list li::before {
        content: "→";
        position: absolute;
        left: 0;
        color: var(--accent);
        font-size: 12px;
        top: 9px;
      }

      /* ── TABLE ── */
      .data-table {
        width: 100%;
        border-collapse: collapse;
        font-size: 13px;
        margin: 1rem 0;
        border-radius: var(--radius);
        overflow: hidden;
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
      }
      .data-table th {
        text-align: left;
        padding: 9px 14px;
        font-size: 9.5px;
        font-weight: 600;
        letter-spacing: 0.09em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        color: var(--text-3);
        background: var(--bg-3);
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-2);
      }
      .data-table td {
        padding: 10px 14px;
        color: var(--text-2);
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
        vertical-align: top;
        line-height: 1.55;
      }
      .data-table tr:last-child td {
        border: none;
      }
      .data-table td:first-child {
        color: var(--text);
        font-family: "IBM Plex Mono", monospace;
        font-size: 11.5px;
      }
      .data-table tr:hover td {
        background: var(--bg-3);
      }

      /* ── LIFECYCLE ── */
      .lifecycle {
        position: relative;
        padding-left: 26px;
        margin: 1rem 0;
      }
      .lifecycle::before {
        content: "";
        position: absolute;
        left: 7px;
        top: 14px;
        bottom: 14px;
        width: 1px;
        background: var(--border-2);
      }
      .lc-item {
        position: relative;
        margin-bottom: 18px;
      }
      .lc-dot {
        position: absolute;
        left: -22px;
        top: 4px;
        width: 8px;
        height: 8px;
        border-radius: 50%;
        background: var(--bg-3);
        border: 2px solid var(--border-2);
      }
      .lc-item.hi .lc-dot {
        background: var(--accent);
        border-color: var(--accent);
      }
      .lc-item h4 {
        font-family: "IBM Plex Mono", monospace;
        font-size: 12px;
        color: var(--teal);
        margin-bottom: 3px;
      }
      .lc-item p {
        font-size: 13px;
        color: var(--text-2);
        line-height: 1.55;
        margin: 0;
      }

      /* ── FLOW DIAGRAM ── */
      .flow {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: flex-start;
        gap: 0;
        margin: 1rem 0;
      }

      .flow-item {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 10px;
      }

      .flow-box {
        background: var(--bg-3);
        border: 1px solid var(--border-2);
        border-radius: var(--radius);
        padding: 8px 16px;
        font-family: "IBM Plex Mono", monospace;
        font-size: 12.5px;
        color: var(--text);
        min-width: 200px;
        text-align: center;
      }

      .flow-box.accent {
        border-color: var(--accent);
        color: var(--accent);
      }
      .flow-box.teal {
        border-color: var(--teal);
        color: var(--teal);
      }
      .flow-box.blue {
        border-color: var(--blue);
        color: var(--blue);
      }
      .flow-box.amber {
        border-color: var(--amber);
        color: var(--amber);
      }
      .flow-box.purple {
        border-color: var(--purple);
        color: var(--purple);
      }

      .flow-arrow {
        font-size: 18px;
        color: var(--text-3);
        line-height: 1;
        padding: 4px 0;
        margin-left: 99px;
      }

      .flow-note {
        font-size: 11px;
        color: var(--text-3);
        font-family: "IBM Plex Mono", monospace;
        margin-left: 10px;
      }

      /* ── FILE TREE ── */
      .file-tree {
        background: var(--bg-2);
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
        padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
        font-family: "IBM Plex Mono", monospace;
        font-size: 12.5px;
        line-height: 2;
        margin: 1rem 0;
      }

      .file-tree .dir {
        color: var(--blue);
      }
      .file-tree .file {
        color: var(--text-2);
      }
      .file-tree .root {
        color: var(--text);
        font-weight: 500;
      }
      .file-tree .badge-file {
        margin-left: 8px;
        font-size: 9px;
        padding: 1px 6px;
        border-radius: 3px;
        background: rgba(45, 203, 160, 0.12);
        color: var(--teal);
        border: 1px solid rgba(45, 203, 160, 0.2);
        vertical-align: middle;
      }

      /* ── PROJECT FILE CARD ── */
      .file-card {
        background: var(--bg-2);
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
        margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        overflow: hidden;
      }

      .file-card-header {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 10px;
        padding: 0.75rem 1.25rem;
        background: var(--bg-3);
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
      }

      .file-card-header .fname {
        font-family: "IBM Plex Mono", monospace;
        font-size: 12px;
        color: var(--teal);
        font-weight: 500;
      }

      .file-card-header .fdesc {
        font-size: 12px;
        color: var(--text-3);
        margin-left: auto;
      }

      .file-card pre {
        border: none;
        border-radius: 0;
        margin: 0;
        background: var(--bg-2);
      }

      .file-card .file-explain {
        padding: 0.85rem 1.25rem;
        border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
        font-size: 13px;
        color: var(--text-2);
        line-height: 1.65;
      }

      /* ── SCROLLBAR ── */
      ::-webkit-scrollbar {
        width: 5px;
        height: 5px;
      }
      ::-webkit-scrollbar-track {
        background: transparent;
      }
      ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {
        background: var(--bg-4);
        border-radius: 3px;
      }

      /* ── RESPONSIVE ── */
      @media (max-width: 860px) {
        .layout {
          flex-direction: column;
        }
        .sidebar {
          width: 100%;
          height: auto;
          position: static;
          border-right: none;
          border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
        }
        .main {
          padding: 1.5rem;
          max-width: 100%;
        }
        .compare {
          grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        }
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="layout">
      <aside class="sidebar">
        <div class="sidebar-logo">
          <div class="logo-tag">Complete Reference Guide</div>
          <h1>Angular<br />Concepts</h1>
          <div class="version">v17+ · Standalone API · Deep Dive</div>
        </div>
        <div id="nav"></div>
      </aside>

      <main class="main">
        <div id="content"></div>
      </main>
    </div>

    <script>
      const navGroups = [
        {
          label: "Foundation",
          sections: ["overview", "typescript", "spa"],
        },
        {
          label: "Core Concepts",
          sections: [
            "components",
            "binding",
            "templates",
            "services",
            "routing",
            "forms",
            "signals",
          ],
        },
        {
          label: "Animations",
          sections: ["animations"],
        },
        {
          label: "Advanced",
          sections: ["rxjs", "di", "lifecycle"],
        },
        { label: "Sections", sections: ["Sections"] }, // ← ADD THIS LINE
        {
          label: "Project Walkthrough",
          sections: [
            "proj_overview",
            "proj_models",
            "proj_services",
            "proj_components",
            "proj_routing",
            "proj_pipes",
            "proj_html_config",
          ],
        },
      ];

      const sections = {
        /* ─────────────────────────────────── FOUNDATION ─────────────────────────────────── */

        overview: {
          label: "Architecture",
          tag: "Foundation",
          title: "Angular Architecture",
          subtitle:
            "Declarative, component-based framework — you describe what the UI should look like for a given state, Angular handles all DOM manipulation automatically.",
          content: `
          <!-- ============================================= -->
          <!-- BLOCK 1: What is Angular Architecture?        -->
          <!-- ============================================= -->
          <div class="block">
            <h3>What is Angular Architecture?</h3>

            <div class="note blue">
              <div class="note-label">📖 Understanding Angular's Building Blocks</div>

              <p><strong>Analogy - Building a House:</strong> Think of Angular architecture like building a house with prefabricated rooms:</p>
              <ul>
                <li><strong>Components</strong> = Individual rooms (kitchen, bedroom, bathroom)</li>
                <li><strong>Templates</strong> = The layout and design of each room</li>
                <li><strong>Services</strong> = Utilities (electricity, water, internet - shared across rooms)</li>
                <li><strong>Router</strong> = Hallways and doors (moving between rooms)</li>
                <li><strong>Modules</strong> = Floors or wings of the house (groups of related rooms)</li>
              </ul>
              <p>You combine these building blocks to create the complete house (application).</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- ============================================= -->
          <!-- BLOCK 2: Architecture Overview                -->
          <!-- ============================================= -->
          <div class="block">
            <h3>Angular Architecture Overview</h3>
            <p>Angular is a <strong>component-based framework</strong>. You describe what the UI should look like for a given state, and Angular handles all DOM manipulation automatically.</p>

            <div class="note purple">
              <div class="note-label">📖 The Six Core Building Blocks</div>

              <div class="card-grid">
                <div class="card col-blue">
                  <div class="card-eyebrow">UI Layer</div>
                  <div class="card-name">Components</div>
                  <div class="card-desc">The only thing the user sees. Owns the template + class + styles. Should contain <em>zero business logic</em> — only UI logic (show/hide, loop, bind).</div>
                </div>

                <div class="card teal">
                  <div class="note-label">📖 Component Explanation</div>
                  <p><strong>Analogy - Restaurant Waiter:</strong> A component is like a waiter. The waiter:</p>
                  <ul>
                    <li>Shows you the menu (template)</li>
                    <li>Takes your order (handles clicks/inputs)</li>
