            <div class="note amber">
              <div class="note-label">🚀 Why SPA is Faster for Navigation</div>

              <p><strong>MPA Navigation Cost:</strong></p>
              <ul>
                <li>HTML download (50-500 KB)</li>
                <li>CSS download and re-parse (20-200 KB)</li>
                <li>JavaScript download and re-evaluate (100-1000 KB)</li>
                <li>Images and assets (variable)</li>
                <li>Full page repaint (browser redraws everything)</li>
                <li><strong>TOTAL: 1-5 seconds, plus data transfer costs</strong></li>
              </ul>

              <p><strong>SPA Navigation Cost (after first load):</strong></p>
              <ul>
                <li>Component swap in memory (almost instant - 1-10ms)</li>
                <li>Optional: JSON API request (often 1-50 KB, very fast)</li>
                <li><strong>TOTAL: 0.05-0.3 seconds, minimal data transfer</strong></li>
              </ul>

              <div class="note green">
                <div class="note-label">📊 Real Numbers Example</div>
                <p><strong>MPA E-commerce site:</strong> Navigating from Home → Products → Product Detail → Cart → Checkout</p>
                <ul>
                  <li>5 page loads × 2 seconds each = <strong>10 seconds of waiting</strong></li>
                  <li>User is frustrated, might leave before completing purchase</li>
                </ul>

                <p><strong>SPA E-commerce site (Angular):</strong> Same navigation</p>
                <ul>
                  <li>First load: 2-3 seconds (download app)</li>
                  <li>Subsequent 4 navigations: 0.2 seconds each = <strong>0.8 seconds total</strong></li>
                  <li>User stays engaged, completes purchase happily</li>
                </ul>
              </div>
