                <li>✅ You're building a web APPLICATION (not just a website)</li>
                <li>✅ Users will interact frequently (click, type, navigate many times)</li>
                <li>✅ You need real-time updates or complex interactions</li>
                <li>✅ You want a desktop/mobile app-like experience</li>
                <li>✅ You can implement SSR or prerendering if SEO is critical</li>
              </ul>

              <p><strong>Choose Traditional MPA if:</strong></p>
              <ul>
