              <div class="note amber">
                <div class="note-label">🎯 Singleton Benefits</div>
                <ul>
                  <li><strong>Shared state</strong> - One component updates, all see the change</li>
                  <li><strong>Memory efficient</strong> - Only one instance in memory</li>
                  <li><strong>Consistent data</strong> - No duplicate or out-of-sync data</li>
                  <li><strong>Caching works</strong> - Data loaded once, reused everywhere</li>
                </ul>
