                <div class="note-label">⚡ Memoization - Why It's Fast</div>
                <p>Notice the console.log statements. They only run when dependencies change!</p>
                <pre data-lang="text">Initial render:
        "Recalculating subtotal..."  ← runs once
        "Recalculating tax..."       ← runs once
        "Recalculating total..."     ← runs once

      Click "Add One" (quantity 3 → 4):
        "Recalculating subtotal..."  ← runs (price or quantity changed)
        "Recalculating tax..."       ← runs (subtotal changed)
        "Recalculating total..."     ← runs (subtotal changed)

