                <li>User types "joh" (before 300ms) → timer resets, still waiting</li>
                <li>User types "john" and stops → after 300ms pause, search triggers</li>
                <li>switchMap cancels any previous incomplete search</li>
                <li>HTTP request sent to API</li>
                <li>Results arrive, update UI</li>
                <li>If component destroys before results arrive, takeUntil cleans up</li>
              </ol>
              <p>This is production-ready code used in real Angular applications!</p>
