          <div class="block">
            <h3>Injection scopes</h3>

            <div class="note coral">
              <div class="note-label">📖 What is a "Scope"?</div>
              <p><strong>Scope = "How many instances of this service exist?"</strong></p>
              <p>Think of a bakery:</p>
              <ul>
                <li><strong>'root' scope</strong> = ONE bakery for the whole city. Everyone buys from the same bakery. (Shared state)</li>
                <li><strong>'any' scope</strong> = Each neighborhood has its own bakery. Not shared across neighborhoods.</li>
                <li><strong>Component scope</strong> = Each house has its own personal bakery. When house is destroyed, bakery is destroyed!</li>
              </ul>
            </div>

            <table class="data-table">
              <thead>
                <tr><th>providedIn</th><th>Scope</th><th>When to use</th></tr>
              </thead>
              <tbody>
                <tr>
                  <td>'root'</td>
                  <td>App-wide singleton</td>
