            <p>Constructor vs ngOnInit: Constructor creates object (dependency injection), ngOnInit runs initialization logic (API calls).</p>
            <p>Observables & RxJS: A stream means data over time. $ usually means Observable stream. BehaviorSubject stores current value and emits updates.</p>
            <pre data-lang="typescript"><span class="kw">private</span> teamsSource = <span class="kw">new</span> BehaviorSubject&lt;<span class="tp">any</span>[]&gt;([]);
