              <p><strong>Lifecycle Hooks - What runs when:</strong> Angular automatically calls these methods at specific times.</p>

              <p><strong>constructor():</strong> First to run. ONLY for dependency injection. Do NOT put API calls here! Angular hasn't set up inputs yet.</p>

              <p><strong>ngOnInit():</strong> Runs AFTER Angular sets up component inputs. This is where you put initialization logic like API calls, setting up subscriptions, loading data.</p>

              <pre data-lang="typescript"><span class="kw">export class</span> UserProfileComponent <span class="kw">implements</span> OnInit {
