                <li><strong>Signal = Messenger</strong> - Runs between kitchen and waiter. When food is ready, messenger tells waiter immediately.</li>
                <li><strong>Router = Road Map</strong> - Shows waiter where to go (which page to show). "/profile" route leads to ProfilePage.</li>
                <li><strong>HttpClient = Delivery Truck</strong> - Brings ingredients (data) from suppliers (external APIs).</li>
